  "translation": "O kɔ, u nana masakɛ ɲɛfɛ kɔrɔfɔ masakɛ ka sariya kan: “Yala masakɛ, i ma sariya sɛbɛn min kɔrɔ ko: mɔgɔ min bɛ bɛɛ fɛ wele Elohim walima hadamaden fɛ, don wolonwula-tan kɔnɔ, ni i yɛrɛ tɛ a la, masakɛ, ko ⟨a⟩ bɛna lagun warabaw ka dugubu kɔnɔ wa?” Masakɛ jaabi ko: “Kuma in ye ⟨tiɲɛ⟩ tiŋɛnen ye, Madawi ani Pɛrɛs ka sariya ye, min tɛ yɛlɛmɛ.”",
